Tabular Editor 2
Copyright (c) Tabular Editor ApS
Licensed under the MIT License.
https://github.com/TabularEditor/TabularEditor

Semanticus vendors and compiles portions of the Tabular Editor 2 source
(TOMWrapper change-tracking/undo, FormulaFixup, BPALib and related headless
libraries) into its engine. The vendored source and its license are retained
under external/TabularEditor/.

One Tabular Editor 2 file is additionally COPIED into this repository rather than
compiled in place: the ANTLR DAX lexer grammar, upstream
AntlrGrammars/DAXLexer.g4, copied to Semanticus.Core/Grammars/DAXLexer.g4 so the
ANTLR code generator can run inside that project. The copy carries its own MIT
attribution header. The grammar rules are upstream's, unmodified. See
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md for the full MIT license text.
